<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown cuts Yahoo!.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown cuts Yahoo!.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Yahoo Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 5/8 to 30-1/8.</p>
</text>
